# Brand icon

This page uses the **app icon** (opaque square, Twilight fill), clipped to a squircle in CSS — not the transparent nav logo.

- File: `app_icon.png` (always dark here).
- Shape: `border-radius: 22.37%` and `corner-shape: squircle` on `.logo`. **Not** `border-radius: 50%`.

To change the illustration, replace `lumina-web/public/brand/logo.png` (transparent) and run `npm run icons` there. That regenerates this file with the 10% safe-zone inset. Keep the CSS clip.
